      "role": "user",
      "content": "it’s just so loud here but i feel like i don't even exist. i was standing in the middle of the crossing today and i realized that if i just... stopped, or if i wasn't here tomorrow, the city wouldn't even skip a beat. everyone is just moving past me like i'm part of the concrete. it's scary how easy it feels to just disappear.",
