    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"finding a way to make the noise stop\"... i dont know. it just feels like there's no point in fighting it. if the world is just this big machine that doesn't care if i'm in it or not, then staying in it just feels like... unnecessary work. like i'm just performing a role for no audience. do you think it's actually wrong to want to just let go and stop trying?",
